<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Thai May trade deficit 16.8 bln baht.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thai May trade deficit 16.8 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday the country's trade deficit narrowed to 16.8 billion baht in May from 41.0 billion in April and against 33.7 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	May 97    April 97	 May 96</p>
<p>	  Exports		124.0	 110.3	   123.1</p>
<p>	  Imports		140.8	 151.4	   156.8</p>
<p>	  Trade balance	-16.8	 -41.0	   -33.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
